X: 1
T: Softly Now the Day Is Ending
C: Words: Thomas Hansen Kingo, 1677.  Translated by Jens Christian Aaberg, before 1927.
C: Music: 'Even Song' or 'Himlen aabnes Mørket Svinder' Andreas Peter Berggreen, 1852.
C: Setting: "Hymnal for Church and Home" (Danish Evangelical Lutheran Synods), 1927.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "Hymnal for Church and Home", Danish Evangelical Lutheran Synods, 1927 Hymn 45
M: 2/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
